{"resourceIdentifier":"3342","resourceName":"XiCO2e: Mexican Reforestation Project","description":"The XiCO2e: Mexican Reforestation Project is a grouped project for the afforestation, reforestation and/or revegetation (hereafter referred to as “ARR”) of lands in the states of Tabasco and Tamaulipas in Mexico. The main goals of this grouped project are:\r\n●\tTo restore degraded areas through the plantation of Gmelina arborea. The project activity will prevent further deterioration of already degraded areas and address soil erosion by providing protection through vegetative cover.\r\n●\tTo mitigate climate change by removing greenhouse gases (GHG) through biomass growth.\r\nThe first project activity instance of the XiCO2e project includes planting 1,014.82 hectares in the state of Tabasco and 204.18 hectares in the state of Tamaulipas, located in southeast and northeast Mexico, respectively. This totals 1,219.01 ha during the monitoring period from 2017 to 2022.\r\nThe project will achieve greenhouse gas (GHG) emissions reductions through carbon sequestration by pools via the reforestation with Gmelina arborea. The estimated annual average is 3,726 tCO2e, and the estimated total GHG emissions reduction and removals amount to 111,781  tCO2e. Monitoring activities for the first verification period started on January 11, 2017 and concluded on July 30, 2022.\r\nThe scenario before the project's implementation involved degraded lands, with the previous land uses being grassland and agricultural lands, currently abandoned and degraded.”\r\nThe project proponents are ALA BOOL ALA BOOL TRUST SA DE CV and FORLIANCE GmbH. The project implementor is PROXYLO S.A.P.I DE C.V.","location":{"latitude":18.081903,"longitude":-93.599042},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2022-08-01","endExclusive":"2022-09-01","endInclusive":"2022-08-31"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"3342"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Tabasco, Tamaulipas"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Multiple Proponents"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"},{"type":"assetSearchLink","value":null,"targetId":"3342"},{"type":"bufferSearchLink","value":null,"targetId":"3342"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"3726"}]},{"code":"TOTAL_BUFFER_POOL_CREDITS","values":[{"type":"integer","value":14930}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Agriculture Forestry and Other Land Use"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_SUBCATERGORY_NAMES","values":[{"type":"string","value":"ARR"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"AR-ACM0003"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_ACREAGE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"1219 Hectares"}]},{"code":"VALIDATOR_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"AENOR CONFIA, S.A. (UNIPERSONAL)"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_REGISTRATION_DATE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"14/02/2025"}]},{"code":"CREDIT_PERIOD_INFO","values":[{"type":"string","value":"1st, 11/01/2017 - 10/01/2047"}]}]}],"documentGroups":[{"code":"VCS_PIPELINE_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Pipeline Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=68824&IDKEY=klksjoiuwqowrnoiuomnckjashoufifmln902309ksdflku098f94908296","documentType":"Draft Project Description","documentName":"VCS-Project-Description-XiCO2e Mexican Reforestation-v4.1.pdf","uploadDate":"2022-06-24T10:46:49.46Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=69197&IDKEY=i8723kjnf7kjandsaslmdv09887vaksmrmnwqkjoiuanfnfuq0795422663","documentType":"Listing Representation","documentName":"VCS-Listing-Representation-Multiple-Representors-v4.1.pdf","uploadDate":"2022-06-30T14:54:58.9Z"}]},{"code":"VCS_REGISTRATION_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Registra